$bLurker.Chat$b — irc.lurker.chat

A small IRC network run by the people who make Lurker (https://lurker.chat).
Everything IRCv3 is switched on. Come say hi in $b#lobby$b; $b#lurker$b is for Lurker support.

  Register a nick:   /msg NickServ REGISTER <password> <email>
  Help:              /msg NickServ HELP   ·   /msg ChanServ HELP
  Rules:             be kind; no spam, no bots without asking an oper.
  Abuse:             abuse@lurker.chat

Nicks are enforced: a registered nick is its owner's. No message history is kept
on this server; Lurker keeps your own.
